{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2_external_review_v2", "label": "PQI External Review April 2026 (v2)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verdict: engineering is genuinely good (measurement infra is the durable product value); live edge is real but marginal (~3pp Brier half-eaten by CLV); the council is 3 effective voices, not 7. Execute Phase 1 on unified criteria before any deployment."}, {"id": "docs_pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2_tier_a_auto_buy", "label": "Tier A (Auto-BUY-and-Hold)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.2 / \u00a77.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Automates entry only; gated on Phase 1 unified criteria, independent of execution-edge validation because it makes no exit decisions. Shipping it before Phase 1 passes turns cluster-collapsed outputs into automatic fills."}, {"id": "docs_pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2_tier_b_take_profit_listener", "label": "Tier B (Take-Profit Listener)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2.md", "source_location": "\u00a75.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Continuous listener with exit logic; gated on Phase 2b MFE analysis showing capturable opportunity above fee drag. Very different carrying costs from Tier A \u2014 the two were wrongly conflated in the original Phase 2 scope."}, {"id": "docs_pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2_llm_spend_constraint", "label": "LLM Spend as Binding Constraint", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A $5/mo VPS handles the pipeline; API spend scales with trigger cadence (~$0.015/run) and a busy continuous-scout weekend blows the $20/mo ceiling \u2014 infra is not the cost binding, LLM spend is."}, {"id": "docs_pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2_capacity_ceiling", "label": "Capacity Ceiling", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tier 2/3 eSports markets often have <$500 depth at best bid/ask; above low-to-mid four figures of bankroll, Kelly-optimal stakes won't fill without eating spread that destroys edge \u2014 capacity is a third orthogonal edge axis."}, {"id": "docs_pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2_ghost_events", "label": "Ghost Events (Gamma List Dropout)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2.md", "source_location": "\u00a74.3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gamma /events list endpoints intermittently drop events (confirmed around mid-match settlement) while individual /events/{id} fetches succeed \u2014 acceptable-with-documentation for Tier A, mandatory to fix for Tier B."}, {"id": "docs_pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2_three_effective_voices", "label": "Three Effective Voices, Not Seven", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2.md", "source_location": "\u00a70 / \u00a72.1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Paying 7x LLM cost for ~3 effective voices (5-agent cluster + weakly-independent Bull + independent-but-miscalibrated Bear), one of which actively degrades council Brier \u2014 the dominant structural concern and a quantifiable, testable defect."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_pqi_external_review_2026_04_v2_external_review_v2", "target": "docs_retrospectives_phase_0_edge_2026_04_phase_0_edge_retrospective", "relati